<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five stocks rose, two fell and 13 were flat in 15.2-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday.</p>
<p>Two stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat at 165 zlotys in 30.8-million-zloty trade.</p>
<p>The WIG 20 index fell 0.8 percent to 1,783.3 points due to nine stocks falling, nine rising and two staying flat in comparison with Monday's main-market fixing.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
